```

Now I need to examine the actual data to understand the structure. Let me look at one of the CSV files to see the format.

```json
{
  "tool": "read_file",
  "args": {
    "path": "data/patches/D0000/train.csv"
  }
}
```

Now let me run this analysis script to understand the datasets and select 4 diverse ones.

```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "cd code && python analyze_datasets.py"
  }
}
```

I need to adjust the path since we're running from the code directory. Let me fix the script.

```json
